    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but how? it's not like i can just wish it away. every time i try to be better, i just end up falling back into the same patterns. it feels more like a curse than anything else. like, no matter what i do, the damage is already done and i'm just dragging it along with me. it's exhausting.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
